# Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio, or Rider),
# or copy the URL into a browser / curl.

@base = http://localhost:5080

### Configuration value
GET {{base}}/

### Route parameter + query string
GET {{base}}/hello/Ada?shout=true

### Options, scoped service, header binding
GET {{base}}/whoami

### Query parameter with a default
GET {{base}}/shelf?max=1

### Route constraint: 200, then 404 for a missing id, then 404 because "abc" is not an int
GET {{base}}/shelf/1

###
GET {{base}}/shelf/99

###
GET {{base}}/shelf/abc

### JSON body -> 201 Created with a Location header
POST {{base}}/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Snow Crash", "year": 1992 }

### Validation -> 400 Problem Details
POST {{base}}/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### Unhandled exception -> 500 Problem Details
GET {{base}}/boom

### Development only
GET {{base}}/debug/env
